''',[('What was unclear about the label?','Which part of the sandwich was local.',['Whether the café sold any food.','The price of a train ticket.','The time the student arrived.'],0),('What did the café change?','It listed the origins of main ingredients.',['It stopped providing any menu.','It guaranteed identical supplies forever.','It moved all farming indoors.'],2),('What is the main benefit of precise descriptions?','They support more informed choices.',['They decide every preference for customers.','They eliminate bad weather.','They make all suppliers identical.'],3)])
R('A Screen-Free Table','注意与习惯', '''
